# files e2e v2: icon-only app bar (labels expand on "..."), sort flyout,
# overflow menu, rename via SIP, real move/copy through the destination
# picker, drag-scrolling and the file:// hand-off to Edge.
# Keyboard key centres: row0 y342 (q17 w49 e81 r113 t145 y177 u209 i241 o273
# p305), row1 y395 (a33 s65 d97 f129 g161 h193 j225 k257 l289), row2 y448
# (shift24 z65 x97 c129 v161 b193 n225 m257 bksp297), row3 y502 (space177
# period258 enter297).
# App bar buttons (64px pitch, y504): Select32 NewFolder96 View160
# Search224 More288; select row: Delete32 Move96 Copy160 Share224.
